@startuml ECU_Startup_Time_Measurement_System

title ECU Startup Time Measurement System - Detailed Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "Main GUI" as GUI
participant "Config Window" as Config
participant "Applications_StartupTime_IG_ON" as MainScript
participant "DLT Viewer" as DLT
participant "ECU Hardware" as ECU
participant "Power Relay" as Relay
participant "Log Parser" as Parser
participant "Excel Generator" as Excel
participant "Report Generator" as Report

== Configuration Phase ==

User -> GUI: Launch Application
GUI -> Config: Open Configuration Window
Config -> Config: load_config()
note right: Loads startup_time_config.json

Config -> User: Display Configuration UI
User -> Config: Configure Settings
note right
- DLT-Viewer Log Capture Time
- Iterations
- Power ON-OFF Delay
- Startup Order Judgement
- ECU Configurations (IP, Type)
- Threshold Settings
end note

User -> Config: Save Configuration
Config -> Config: save_config()
Config -> GUI: Configuration Complete

== Test Initialization Phase ==

User -> GUI: Start Test
GUI -> MainScript: start_startup_time_measurement()
MainScript -> MainScript: setup_logging()
note right: Initialize colored logging system

MainScript -> MainScript: load_config()
MainScript -> MainScript: validate_ip_address()
note right: Validate all ECU IP addresses

MainScript -> MainScript: remove_png_files()
note right: Clean up previous graph files

MainScript -> MainScript: create_dlp_files()
note right: Generate DLT project files for each ECU

== Test Execution Loop ==

loop For each iteration (1 to N)
    
    == Power Control Phase ==
    MainScript -> Relay: power_ON_OFF_Relay()
    Relay -> ECU: Power ON
    note right: Start ECU boot sequence
    
    MainScript -> MainScript: Wait for boot delay
    
    == Log Capture Phase ==
    MainScript -> DLT: capture_logs_from_dlt_viewer()
    DLT -> ECU: Connect via IP
    DLT -> DLT: Start log capture
    note right: Capture logs for configured duration
    
    DLT -> MainScript: Log file saved
    
    == Log Processing Phase ==
    MainScript -> MainScript: process_log_file()
    MainScript -> Parser: extract_welcome_timestamp()
    Parser -> Parser: Search for welcome timestamp
    Parser -> MainScript: Welcome timestamp
    
    MainScript -> Parser: extract_dltstart_timestamps()
    Parser -> Parser: Parse application start timestamps
    Parser -> MainScript: Application timestamps
    
    MainScript -> Parser: extract_process_timestamps()
    Parser -> Parser: Parse process timing information
    Parser -> MainScript: Process timing data
    
    == Data Analysis Phase ==
    MainScript -> MainScript: calculate_differences()
    note right: Calculate startup times relative to welcome timestamp
    
    MainScript -> MainScript: validate_app_startup_order()
    note right: Check if applications started in expected order
    
    == Excel Reporting Phase ==
    MainScript -> Excel: create_workBook()
    Excel -> Excel: Create workbook with multiple sheets
    
    MainScript -> Excel: write_data_to_excel()
    Excel -> Excel: Write iteration data to sheet
    Excel -> Excel: format_excel_cells()
    Excel -> Excel: adjust_column_width()
    
    MainScript -> Excel: add_logfile_hyperlink()
    Excel -> Excel: Add hyperlink to source log file
    
    == Power Control Phase ==
    MainScript -> Relay: Power OFF
    Relay -> ECU: Power OFF
    MainScript -> MainScript: Wait for power off delay
    
end loop

== Final Report Generation Phase ==

MainScript -> Excel: export_and_plot_average_data_to_excel()
Excel -> Excel: Calculate min/max/average statistics
Excel -> Excel: plot_process_startup_time_graph()
note right: Generate startup time graphs

Excel -> Excel: plot_process_individual_apps_avg_graph()
note right: Generate individual app performance graphs

Excel -> Excel: plot_process_start_end_time_graph()
note right: Generate start/end time analysis graphs

MainScript -> Excel: generate_apps_startup_report_from_QNX_startup()
Excel -> Excel: Create comprehensive startup report

MainScript -> Excel: generate_apps_start_end_time_report()
Excel -> Excel: Create start/end time report

MainScript -> Excel: each_iteration_test_status()
Excel -> Excel: Create overall test status summary

MainScript -> Excel: add_appendix_sheet()
Excel -> Excel: Add documentation appendix

== Report Finalization ==

MainScript -> Report: save_workbook_and_generate_reports()
Report -> Report: Save Excel file with timestamp
Report -> Report: Apply final formatting
Report -> User: Display report location

MainScript -> MainScript: remove_png_files()
note right: Clean up temporary graph files

MainScript -> GUI: Test Complete
GUI -> User: Show completion message

== Error Handling (Throughout Process) ==

alt Error in any phase
    MainScript -> MainScript: Log error with colorlog
    MainScript -> User: Display error message
    MainScript -> MainScript: Cleanup resources
end

== Data Structures Used ==

note over MainScript
Key Data Structures:
- dltstart_timestamps: Dict of app startup times
- process_timing_info: Process start/end times
- application_startup_order: Expected vs actual order
- workbook_map: Excel workbooks per ECU type
- threshold_map: Performance thresholds
- config: Configuration parameters
end note

== Configuration Data Flow ==

note over Config
Configuration includes:
- ECU Types: RCAR, SoC0, SoC1, PADAS
- Network: IP addresses per ECU
- Timing: Capture duration, iterations
- Analysis: Startup order validation
- Thresholds: Performance limits
- Hardware: Power relay settings
end note

== Report Output Structure ==

note over Excel
Excel Report Contains:
1. Individual iteration data
2. Min/Max/Average analysis
3. Startup order validation
4. Performance threshold checks
5. Visual graphs and charts
6. Log file hyperlinks
7. Test status summary
8. Documentation appendix
end note

@enduml
